Therefore:

$ 200 = \frac{a}{10(1 - r)} $

Therefore:

$ \frac{a}{1 - r} = 2000 $

Then, $ S_{6033} = \frac{a}{1 - r} \times (1 - r^{6033}) = 2000 \times (1 - r^{6033}) $

Since $ r^{2011} = \frac{9}{10} $, then $ r^{6033} = \left( r^{2011} \right)^3 = \left( \frac{9}{10} \right)^3 = \frac{729}{1000} $

Therefore:

